{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Media Centaur Local API",
    "version": "1",
    "description": "JSON API for scripts and agents on this computer or the local network: find media, start downloads, and follow them through to import. Downloads started here are tracked and imported like any started in the app.\n\n**Enable it:** Settings → Feature Flags → Local API, then Settings → Local API → Generate key. While the flag is off every path answers 404.\n\n**Authenticate:** send `Authorization: Bearer <key>` on every request, loopback included.\n\n**Security:** the API uses plain HTTP. Anyone who can capture traffic on your network can read the key.\n\n**Errors:** every failure has the body `{\"error\": {\"code\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\"}}`. Branch on `code`.\n\n## Choosing a workflow\n\n**Let Media Centaur choose the releases (recommended).** It matches releases to the exact title, skips episodes you own, and applies your quality settings.\n\n1. `GET /titles?q=Sample Show` and take a `tmdb_id` and `media_type`.\n2. `POST /plans` with those and `\"approval_policy\": \"automatic\"`. The answer is the plan, in status `planning`.\n3. Poll `GET /plans/{id}` until `status` is no longer `planning`.\n   - `committed`: `pursuit_id` is set. Go to step 4.\n   - `ready` with `awaiting_approval: true`: read `units`, then `POST /plans/{id}/approve` or `POST /plans/{id}/discard`. An automatic plan stops here unless every wanted unit was found within your quality settings. Approving commits the units that were found.\n   - `ready` with `awaiting_approval: false`: the commit is in progress. Poll again.\n4. Poll `GET /pursuits/{id}` until `state` is `satisfied`, `partial`, `exhausted` or `cancelled`.\n\n**Choose the release yourself.**\n\n1. `GET /releases?q=Sample Show S01E{01-02}`. Braces expand to one search per term: `{01-02}` is a range and `{a,b}` a list. A term with `status: \"failed\"` is an indexer failure, not an absence of releases.\n2. `POST /grabs` with the `q` you searched as `query`, and the `guid` and `term` of each chosen release. The answer has a `pursuit_id`.\n3. Poll `GET /pursuits/{id}` as above. A pursuit with `awaiting_decision: true` needs a person to pick an alternative in the app.\n\nSearch results are reused for 30 minutes; pass `refresh=true` to search the indexers again. `POST /grabs` and `POST /plans` are not idempotent: a repeated request starts another download or plan."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/api/v1"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "apiKey": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Status"
    },
    {
      "name": "Releases"
    },
    {
      "name": "Titles"
    },
    {
      "name": "Plans"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pursuits"
    },
    {
      "name": "Queue"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/status": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "getStatus",
        "tags": [
          "Status"
        ],
        "summary": "Version and integration readiness",
        "description": "Check this first: `acquisition` must be true before anything can be downloaded.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Readiness.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Status"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "The API key is missing or wrong.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/openapi.json": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "getOpenApi",
        "tags": [
          "Status"
        ],
        "summary": "This document",
        "description": "The OpenAPI document for the running version.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OpenAPI 3.1 document.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "The API key is missing or wrong.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/releases": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "searchReleases",
        "tags": [
          "Releases"
        ],
        "summary": "Search the indexers",
        "description": "Expands braces and searches each term. Each term reports its own outcome. Can take up to 15 seconds.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "One entry per term, in term order.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReleaseSearch"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "A parameter is missing or invalid (`invalid_request`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Malformed braces (`invalid_query`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Prowlarr or TMDB is not set up (`not_configured`). See `GET /status`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "The API key is missing or wrong.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "q",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "Search text. Braces expand: `Sample Show S01E{01-02}`."
          },
          {
            "name": "refresh",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "true",
                "false"
              ],
              "default": "false"
            },
            "description": "`true` skips the 30-minute reuse of earlier results."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/grabs": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "grabReleases",
        "tags": [
          "Releases"
        ],
        "summary": "Download chosen releases",
        "description": "Starts one pursuit covering every listed release. An unknown guid downloads nothing. Not idempotent.",
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "The pursuit was recorded; downloading follows.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Grab"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "A parameter is missing or invalid (`invalid_request`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "A guid no search has recorded (`release_unavailable`); the message names it.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Prowlarr or TMDB is not set up (`not_configured`). See `GET /status`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "The API key is missing or wrong.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GrabRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "query": "Sample Show S01E{01-02}",
                "releases": [
                  {
                    "guid": "guid-from-search",
                    "term": "Sample Show S01E01"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/titles": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "searchTitles",
        "tags": [
          "Titles"
        ],
        "summary": "Search TMDB for a film or series",
        "description": "Use the answer's `tmdb_id` and `media_type` with `POST /plans`. A trailing year narrows the search: `Sample Movie 2010`.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Matches, most relevant first.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TitleSearch"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "A parameter is missing or invalid (`invalid_request`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "TMDB did not answer (`upstream_error`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Prowlarr or TMDB is not set up (`not_configured`). See `GET /status`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "The API key is missing or wrong.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "q",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/plans": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "createPlan",
        "tags": [
          "Plans"
        ],
        "summary": "Have Media Centaur choose releases for a title",
        "description": "Answers at once in status `planning`; searching runs in the background. Not idempotent.",
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "The plan.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Plan"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "A parameter is missing or invalid (`invalid_request`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "TMDB has no such title.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Nothing left to download (`nothing_to_plan`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Prowlarr or TMDB is not set up (`not_configured`). See `GET /status`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "The API key is missing or wrong.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlanRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "tmdb_id": 12345,
                "media_type": "tv",
                "approval_policy": "automatic",
                "scope": "latest_season"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/plans/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "getPlan",
        "tags": [
          "Plans"
        ],
        "summary": "Read a plan",
        "description": "",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
